{"genre":"records","rules_en":"Fill the grid with digits 1..N (weekly training loads) so that every row and every column contains each digit exactly once. A number outside the grid tells how many times a new record is set when reading that row or column from that side: a value counts as a record if it is larger than every value before it (the first value always counts). Deload ▼: a digit in a ▼ cell is smaller than both its left and right neighbours. Given digits are fixed.","rules_ru":"Впишите в сетку цифры от 1 до N (недельные нагрузки) так, чтобы в каждой строке и каждом столбце каждая цифра встречалась ровно один раз. Число за краем сетки показывает, сколько раз ставится новый рекорд, если читать строку или столбец с этой стороны: значение — рекорд, если оно больше всех предыдущих (первое значение всегда рекорд). Разгрузка ▼: цифра в клетке с ▼ меньше обеих соседних по горизонтали (слева и справа). Данные цифры менять нельзя.","puzzles":[{"id":"r-e1","difficulty":"easy","n":4,"top":[null,4,null,null],"bottom":[4,null,null,null],"left":[null,null,null,null],"right":[null,null,2,3],"deload":[],"givens":[],"solution":[[4,1,2,3],[3,2,1,4],[2,3,4,1],[1,4,3,2]]},{"id":"r-e2","difficulty":"easy","n":4,"top":[null,null,null,null],"bottom":[null,1,null,3],"left":[4,null,null,null],"right":[null,null,4,null],"deload":[],"givens":[],"solution":[[1,2,3,4],[2,1,4,3],[4,3,2,1],[3,4,1,2]]},{"id":"r-e3","difficulty":"easy","n":4,"top":[null,null,null,null],"bottom":[4,null,1,null],"left":[null,null,null,null],"right":[3,null,1,null],"deload":[[0,2]],"givens":[],"solution":[[4,3,1,2],[3,4,2,1],[2,1,3,4],[1,2,4,3]]},{"id":"r-e4","difficulty":"easy","n":4,"top":[null,null,null,null],"bottom":[null,null,1,null],"left":[null,4,1,null],"right":[null,null,null,null],"deload":[[2,2]],"givens":[],"solution":[[3,4,2,1],[1,2,3,4],[4,3,1,2],[2,1,4,3]]},{"id":"r-m1","difficulty":"medium","n":5,"top":[null,null,null,null,1],"bottom":[null,null,null,2,null],"left":[2,null,4,null,null],"right"